"We accept payments via Stripe (Credit Card, PayPal, Klarna) and Bank Wire "
"Transfer."
msgstr ""
"Nous acceptons les paiements par Stripe (Carte de crédit, PayPal, Klarna) et"
" virement bancaire."

#: app/templates/policies/terms.html:19
