msgstr "Tous les prix sont en EUR et incluent les taxes applicables (TVA)."

#: app/templates/policies/terms.html:20
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Base rate €130/night. +10% weekends and Italian public holidays. +€15/night "
"per extra guest over 2."
msgstr ""
"Tarif de base 130 €/nuit. +10% week-ends et jours fériés italiens. +15 "
